# Dialog UI: three friends chat so the presenters have something to show.
# Ada starts a conversation every so often; Bo and Cy answer with followups. Everyone also mutters
# to themselves now and then, so several lines overlap and you can see how each presenter stacks them.
# Press Space to make Cy shout, which interrupts whatever Cy was saying.

rule AdaStarts
  who Ada
  concept TalkIdle
  cooldown 10s
  select norepeat
  say "Has anyone seen my umbrella? I had it a minute ago."
  say "I've been thinking about taking up the trombone."
  say "Does anyone else hear that humming, or is it just me?"
  then Bo BoAnswers after 0.3s

rule BoAnswers
  who Bo
  concept BoAnswers
  select norepeat
  say "Not since Tuesday."
  say "Please don't."
  say "That's the fridge. It's always the fridge."
  then Cy CyAnswers after 0.3s

rule CyAnswers
  who Cy
  concept CyAnswers
  select norepeat
  say "I think it's a long sentence that wraps over a few lines, so you can watch the typewriter reveal fill the bubble."
  say "Agreed."
  say "Hm."

rule Mutter
  concept TalkIdle
  if rand < 35
  cooldown 6s
  say "Hmm-hmm-hmm."
  say "Where was I?"
  say "Lovely day."

rule CyShouts
  who Cy
  concept Shout
  say "Hey! Over here!"
